! GitHub Projects Browser Plugin

Display GitHub repositories in a clean card grid layout.

!! Usage

Display repositories from an organization:

```
<$github-projects org="selfapplied" />
```

The widget fetches repositories from the GitHub API and displays:
* Repository name
* Description
* Star count
* Last updated date
* Primary language
* Link to GitHub

!! Features

* Fetches from GitHub API
* Responsive card grid layout
* Shows stars, update dates, and languages
* Direct links to GitHub repositories
* Error handling for API failures


